{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unknot the knot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Untangle the Intricate Web of Knots with Intuitive Puzzle Gameplay &amp; Realistic Knot Theory Simulation</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Untangle with Simple, Intuitive Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a4865f0b5ad7a18d08ee87718acd0a69.poster.avif?t=1772465186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a4865f0b5ad7a18d08ee87718acd0a69.webm?t=1772465186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a4865f0b5ad7a18d08ee87718acd0a69.mp4?t=1772465186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dive into a puzzle experience where unraveling complex, intertwined ropes is all about insight and strategy. Enjoy a user-friendly interface that lets you focus on thoughtful problem-solving and exploration at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesmerizing, Fluid Rope Dynamics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/49ad874df80b69b2a495aa8ccdc2420e.poster.avif?t=1772465186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/49ad874df80b69b2a495aa8ccdc2420e.webm?t=1772465186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/49ad874df80b69b2a495aa8ccdc2420e.mp4?t=1772465186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Watch as the ropes come to life with smooth, natural movements. The realistic simulation captures the fluid, almost hypnotic dance of every twist and turn, offering a visually satisfying experience that feels both organic and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Simulation of Knot Theory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/8cccf5ebb123223f3261c0e058aeedbf.avif?t=1772465186\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100</strong> puzzle levels with core mechanics grounded in <strong>mathematical knot theory</strong>\u2014whether you love math or puzzle games, you\u2019ll find a <strong>brand-new experience</strong> here!<br><br>Mail:\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:kaxon.gxxx@gmail.com\">kaxon.gxxx@gmail.com</a></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unknot!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544020/882ebb6140df6852d2a2f7c341d141f046ecfb85.jpg"},{"name":"First Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544020/8b38371d57fadf437a200096ce3fe66b2fc5fdfb.jpg"},{"name":"5 Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544020/33b6e3ed837bc3cc4d52b9453dc7e8ed072bacd1.jpg"},{"name":"Star Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544020/5b67d011a0ec1be4c7a20ac0df24f1a7c7c8e3ce.jpg"},{"name":"Star Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544020/d58f101871c0ea1f171f150684f38c8e72189c81.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Unknot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544020/bd742bc2ef5c200f8bd267e6f846a5ead1ff0fdd.jpg"},{"name":"First Knot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544020/72151c013f504e1a5256f5928d89f9df5179